{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review advisory resolution and frozen test contract card:\n\n- Trigger: timing is armed when CI has a conventional truthy value or REBAR_FIXTURE_TIMING=1; otherwise it is silent. The threshold is 1.0 monotonic seconds.\n- Interception: the editor fixture wraps the exact ThreadingHTTPServer constructor, socketserver.TCPServer.server_bind, and socket.getfqdn callables only during edit_workflow setup, restoring each before the test body. This separates nested constructor, bind, and reverse-DNS spans while preserving arguments, return values, and exceptions.\n- Authoritative contract: the ticket acceptance criteria and operator requirement require attribution of any operation/test over 30 seconds without changing coverage or behavior.\n- Preconditions: deterministic fake monotonic readings cross 1.0s with timing armed; the focused editor fixture exercises the real edit_workflow path.\n- Test tier: in-process unit tests for threshold/env/emission and callable transparency, plus the existing focused real editor fixture path; a source-text assertion would not prove runtime attribution.\n- Observable postconditions: emitted records name worker, node, fixture/span, and elapsed seconds; unarmed and sub-threshold controls emit nothing; wrapped calls return the exact result and re-raise the exact exception.\n- Gate: the new observability test module and focused editor module run under the default pytest CI gate, followed by lint and typecheck.\n- Negative controls: unarmed timing and a 0.99s span remain silent.\n\nThe organic post-merge run remains the deliberate Stage-3 dynamic experiment and will be recorded before this investigation ticket closes."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786745695073958001,"uuid":"6715617b-2ccb-4567-b90f-f3217cac962d"}